flowchart TD
    A[进入数据源管理 Tab] --> B[GET datasources?pageNum&pageSize]
    B --> C[读取 list / total]
    C --> D[展示分页列表]
    D --> E{用户操作}
    E --> F[新增或编辑]
    F --> G[填写 DataSourcePayload，密码必填]
    G --> H[POST 或 PUT datasources]
    H --> I[刷新列表]
    E --> J[确认删除]
    J -->|取消| D
    J -->|确认| K[DELETE datasources/id]
    K --> I
    E --> L[GET datasources/id/metrics]
    L --> M[展示连接池指标]
